    "body":  {
                 "storage":  {
                                 "value":  "\u003cp /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a \u003c/strong\u003esystem user\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to \u003c/strong\u003ebe able to copy Penalty while creating new Penalty or editing already existing Penalties\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003eI have possibility to use already configured Penalty parameters with possibility to update it before saving \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to use \u0026lsquo;Copy from\u0026rsquo; button to choose from which Penalty to copy In Creating /Editing process\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy clicking on a \u0026lsquo;Copy from\u0026rsquo; button will open new pop-up window with one dropdown:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDropdown contains list of all Penalties (excluding deleted items): \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShould display Penalty name and ID (unique identifier of Penalty)\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrder of Penalties in dropdown list should be ID DESC\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWill be possible to search in dropdown by Penalty name and ID\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter selecting Penalty and clicking on a \u0026lsquo;Copy\u0026rsquo; button in Pop-up window system should do following:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisplay all copied settings in a new Penalty creation page \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf in creation page some values were added before copying Penalty, old values will be replaced by newly copied settings \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the copied settings from the existing Penalty includes already inactive for selection nomenclature the respective fields in the new form should remain empty. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf sub-object (payment term) contains nomenclature which is inactive, such payment terms shouldn\u0026rsquo;t be copied\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking On \u0026lsquo;Create Penalty\u0026rsquo; will create new Penalty \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit Log\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit Log record should be created on adding/Editing/Removing actions\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo need to create Audit Log record on Move to top/Drag \u0026amp; Drop\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
                                 "representation":  "storage",
                                 "embeddedContent":  [

                                                     ],
                                 "_expandable":  {
                                                     "content":  "/rest/api/content/12845146"
                                                 }
                             },
                 "view":  {
                              "value":  "\u003cp /\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAs a \u003c/strong\u003esystem userÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI want to \u003c/strong\u003ebe able to copy Penalty while creating new Penalty or editing already existing Penalties\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSo that \u003c/strong\u003eI have possibility to use already configured Penalty parameters with possibility to update it before saving Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAcceptance Criteria\u003c/strong\u003eÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt is possible to use âCopy fromâ button to choose from which Penalty to copy In Creating /Editing processÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy clicking on a âCopy fromâ button will open new pop-up window with one dropdown:Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDropdown contains list of all Penalties (excluding deleted items): Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eShould display Penalty name and ID (unique identifier of Penalty)Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrder of Penalties in dropdown list should be ID DESCÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWill be possible to search in dropdown by Penalty name and IDÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter selecting Penalty and clicking on a âCopyâ button in Pop-up window system should do following:Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDisplay all copied settings in a new Penalty creation page Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003col start=\"1\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf in creation page some values were added before copying Penalty, old values will be replaced by newly copied settings Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf the copied settings from the existing Penalty includes already inactive for selection nomenclature the respective fields in the new form should remain empty. Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf sub-object (payment term) contains nomenclature which is inactive, such payment terms shouldnât be copied\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClicking On âCreate Penaltyâ will create new Penalty Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit LogÂ Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAudit Log record should be created on adding/Editing/Removing actionsÂ Â Â \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eNo need to create Audit Log record on Move to top/Drag \u0026amp; DropÂ \u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e",
